  "question": {
    "text": "A stationary source is emitted sound at a fixed frequency&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>, which is reflected by two cars approaching the source. The difference between the is frequencies of sound reflected from the car is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>. What is the difference in the speed of the cars (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)? The cars are moving at constant speeds much smaller than the speed of sound which is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>330</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.98",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Firstly, car will be treated as an observer which is approaching the source. Then, it will be treated as a source, which is moving in the direction of sound.<br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image14-dbdd96e6-64bd-4b6f-bc44-2868ca507287.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 217px; height: 51px;\" /><br /><br />Hence,<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Or<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;are very very less than v.<br /><br />We can write, <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8776;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mi>O</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>300</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.2</mo></mrow><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.98</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
